<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Bolton 1996 net rises 42.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Bolton 1996 net rises 42.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  47.99   vs	  33.64</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 29.24   vs	  24.57</p>
<p>    Turnover		   149.81   vs	 112.44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    62.12   vs	  41.55</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.75   vs   less  0.79</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  1.79   vs   add  11.23</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	10.0    vs	   9.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Bolton Properties Bhd is involved in property and other businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
